Then I go to the vegetable section.
I take a bag of potatoes.
Then I look for mustard and mayonnaise.
I walk through the aisles.
I find a small jar of mustard.
Afterwards I pack a jar of mayonnaise into my basket.
Now I have all the ingredients for my potato salad.
I go to the till.
The cashier scans my groceries.
"That is fourteen Euro and eighty cents, please," she says.
I pay with my card.
"Do you need the receipt?" she asks me.
"Yes, please," I answer.
She gives me the receipt.
"Have a nice day," she says.
"Thank you, you too," I answer.
I pack everything carefully into my backpack.
The meat and the potatoes are at the very bottom.
Everything fits in well.
Then I walk quickly home.
